[2026-03-15T21:15:05.867Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_013YFRhoqHmKrwPc6NawvEkY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BHWPu2k1RvRwY4puKfMxsZ","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md","offset":364,"limit":200},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":161,"cache_read_input_tokens":20848,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":161,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015uXTmpbyoF4wrMgqSUBzfA","session_id":"40a51b1f-3249-44ca-a03e-506c11f5118e","uuid":"c93b047f-a5ab-4592-b1a9-c54a79a348fa"}
[2026-03-15T21:15:06.253Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BHWPu2k1RvRwY4puKfMxsZ","type":"tool_result","content":"   364→## Page: Property Detail (`/properties/:id`)\n   365→\n   366→<!-- Components: ImageGallery, PropertyHeader, PropertyInfo, PropertyDescription, AmenitiesList, BookingCard, ReviewsSection, HostInfoCard -->\n   367→\n   368→### Component: ImageGallery\n   369→\n   370→#### Test: Image gallery displays main large image and smaller thumbnails\n   371→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with 5 images.\n   372→- **Expected:** The image gallery shows a grid layout with the first image (lowest display_order) displayed as a large main image, and the remaining images displayed as smaller thumbnails alongside or below it. All images have rounded corners.\n   373→\n   374→#### Test: Image gallery displays single image when property has only one image\n   375→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with exactly 1 image.\n   376→- **Expected:** The single image is displayed as the main large image. No thumbnail grid is shown.\n   377→\n   378→#### Test: Image gallery displays placeholder when property has no images\n   379→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no images.\n   380→- **Expected:** A placeholder image or \"No images available\" message is displayed in the gallery area.\n   381→\n   382→#### Test: Clicking a thumbnail image makes it the main displayed image\n   383→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with 5 images. The first image is displayed as the main image.\n   384→- **Action:** User clicks on the third thumbnail image.\n   385→- **Expected:** The third image becomes the main large image. The previously main image moves to the thumbnail grid.\n   386→\n   387→#### Test: Clicking thumbnails is functional on repeated use\n   388→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with multiple images.\n   389→- **Action:** User clicks the second thumbnail, then the fourth thumbnail, then the first thumbnail.\n   390→- **Expected:** Each click updates the main image to the clicked thumbnail. The final state shows the first thumbnail as the main image.\n   391→\n   392→#### Test: Image gallery shows image captions when available\n   393→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The property has images with caption text set.\n   394→- **Expected:** Captions are displayed below or overlaying their respective images.\n   395→\n   396→### Component: PropertyHeader\n   397→\n   398→#### Test: Property header displays title, location, rating summary, and host info\n   399→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with title \"Luxury Villa in Bali\", city \"Ubud\", country \"Indonesia\", an average rating of 4.7 from 23 reviews, hosted by \"Jane Host\" with an avatar.\n   400→- **Expected:** The property header shows the title \"Luxury Villa in Bali\", location \"Ubud, Indonesia\", a star icon with \"4.7\" and \"(23 reviews)\", and the host name \"Jane Host\" with their avatar image.\n   401→\n   402→#### Test: Property header shows \"New\" when property has no reviews\n   403→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no reviews.\n   404→- **Expected:** The rating summary area shows \"New\" or no rating display instead of a numeric rating and review count.\n   405→\n   406→#### Test: Clicking review count scrolls to or navigates to reviews section\n   407→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with reviews.\n   408→- **Action:** User clicks the \"(23 reviews)\" link in the property header.\n   409→- **Expected:** The page scrolls down to the ReviewsSection on the same page.\n   410→\n   411→#### Test: Property header displays host avatar as clickable element\n   412→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page. The host has an avatar_url set.\n   413→- **Expected:** The host's avatar image is displayed as a small circular image next to the host name. The host name is displayed next to the avatar.\n   414→\n   415→### Component: PropertyInfo\n   416→\n   417→#### Test: Property info section displays all property details\n   418→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with property_type \"Villa\", max_guests 6, bedrooms 3, beds 4, bathrooms 2.\n   419→- **Expected:** The property info section displays: \"Villa\" as the property type, \"6 guests\", \"3 bedrooms\", \"4 beds\", and \"2 bathrooms\". Each detail has an appropriate icon.\n   420→\n   421→#### Test: Property info section displays check-in and check-out times\n   422→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with check_in_time \"15:00\" and check_out_time \"11:00\".\n   423→- **Expected:** The property info section shows check-in time as \"3:00 PM\" (or \"15:00\") and check-out time as \"11:00 AM\" (or \"11:00\").\n   424→\n   425→#### Test: Property info section handles singular and plural labels correctly\n   426→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with max_guests 1, bedrooms 1, beds 1, bathrooms 1.\n   427→- **Expected:** Labels display in singular form: \"1 guest\", \"1 bedroom\", \"1 bed\", \"1 bathroom\" (not \"1 guests\", etc.).\n   428→\n   429→### Component: PropertyDescription\n   430→\n   431→#### Test: Property description displays full description text\n   432→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with a multi-paragraph description.\n   433→- **Expected:** The full property description text is displayed in a readable format with proper paragraph breaks.\n   434→\n   435→#### Test: Long description shows a \"Show more\" toggle\n   436→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with a very long description (multiple paragraphs).\n   437→- **Expected:** The description is initially truncated after a reasonable length with a \"Show more\" link/button visible at the bottom.\n   438→\n   439→#### Test: Clicking \"Show more\" expands the full description\n   440→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with a truncated description and a visible \"Show more\" link.\n   441→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Show more\" link.\n   442→- **Expected:** The full description expands to show all text. The link changes to \"Show less\".\n   443→\n   444→#### Test: Clicking \"Show less\" collapses the description back\n   445→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with the description fully expanded and a \"Show less\" link visible.\n   446→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Show less\" link.\n   447→- **Expected:** The description collapses back to the truncated view with \"Show more\" visible again.\n   448→\n   449→#### Test: Show more/less toggle is functional on repeated use\n   450→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with a long description.\n   451→- **Action:** User clicks \"Show more\", then \"Show less\", then \"Show more\" again.\n   452→- **Expected:** Each click correctly toggles between the truncated and expanded states. The final state shows the full description.\n   453→\n   454→### Component: AmenitiesList\n   455→\n   456→#### Test: Amenities list displays amenities grouped by category with icons\n   457→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with amenities including \"WiFi\" (Essentials), \"Pool\" (Features), \"Smoke Detector\" (Safety), \"Near Beach\" (Location).\n   458→- **Expected:** The amenities are displayed in groups with category headings: \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\". Each amenity is shown with its icon and name.\n   459→\n   460→#### Test: Amenities list only shows categories that have amenities\n   461→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The property has amenities only in \"Essentials\" and \"Features\" categories (none in \"Safety\" or \"Location\").\n   462→- **Expected:** Only the \"Essentials\" and \"Features\" category groups are displayed. Empty categories are not shown.\n   463→\n   464→#### Test: Amenities list shows \"Show all amenities\" when there are many amenities\n   465→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with more than 10 amenities.\n   466→- **Expected:** An initial subset of amenities is displayed with a \"Show all X amenities\" button at the bottom (where X is the total count).\n   467→\n   468→#### Test: Clicking \"Show all amenities\" reveals the complete list\n   469→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with many amenities and a \"Show all X amenities\" button visible.\n   470→- **Action:** User clicks \"Show all X amenities\".\n   471→- **Expected:** All amenities are displayed, grouped by category. The button changes to \"Show less\" or disappears.\n   472→\n   473→#### Test: Amenities list displays message when property has no amenities\n   474→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no amenities.\n   475→- **Expected:** A message like \"No amenities listed\" is displayed, or the amenities section is not shown.\n   476→\n   477→### Component: BookingCard\n   478→\n   479→#### Test: Booking card displays price per night\n   480→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with price_per_night $150.\n   481→- **Expected:** The booking card (sticky sidebar on desktop) shows \"$150 / night\" prominently at the top.\n   482→\n   483→#### Test: Booking card displays check-in and check-out date pickers\n   484→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n   485→- **Expected:** The booking card contains a check-in date picker and a check-out date picker. Both are initially empty or show placeholder text.\n   486→\n   487→#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n   488→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 6.\n   489→- **Expected:** The booking card contains a guest count selector. The selector enforces a minimum of 1 and a maximum of 6 (the property's max_guests value).\n   490→\n   491→#### Test: Selecting dates and guests shows price breakdown\n   492→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with price_per_night $150 and cleaning_fee $75.\n   493→- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" (3 nights) and sets guests to 2.\n   494→- **Expected:** The booking card displays a price breakdown: \"$150 x 3 nights = $450\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $525\". The breakdown appears after both dates are selected.\n   495→\n   496→#### Test: Price breakdown updates when dates change\n   497→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\" selected (3 nights).\n   498→- **Action:** User changes the check-out date to \"2026-05-06\" (5 nights).\n   499→- **Expected:** The price breakdown updates to reflect 5 nights: \"$150 x 5 nights = $750\", \"Cleaning fee: $75\", \"Total: $825\".\n   500→\n   501→#### Test: Reserve button creates a booking when logged in\n   502→- **Initial state:** User is logged in, on a property detail page for another user's property. Check-in \"2026-05-01\", check-out \"2026-05-04\", and 2 guests are selected.\n   503→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n   504→- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/bookings` with the property_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, and total_price. A success message is displayed (e.g., \"Booking confirmed!\") and the user is redirected to the My Trips page (`/trips`), or a confirmation is shown on the same page.\n   505→\n   506→#### Test: Reserve button is disabled when dates are not selected\n   507→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on a property detail page. No dates have been selected.\n   508→- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled/grayed out and not clickable. A hint message like \"Select dates to book\" may be displayed.\n   509→\n   510→#### Test: Reserve button prompts login when user is not logged in\n   511→- **Initial state:** User is not logged in and is on a property detail page with valid dates and guests selected.\n   512→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Reserve\" button.\n   513→- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). Alternatively, a message like \"Please log in to book\" is displayed.\n   514→\n   515→#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n   516→- **Initial state:** User is logged in as the host of the current property. Dates and guests are selected.\n   517→- **Expected:** The \"Reserve\" button is disabled or hidden. A message like \"You cannot book your own property\" is displayed.\n   518→\n   519→#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n   520→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n   521→- **Action:** User opens the check-in date picker.\n   522→- **Expected:** Dates before today are disabled/grayed out and cannot be selected.\n   523→\n   524→#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date\n   525→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page and has selected check-in \"2026-05-01\".\n   526→- **Action:** User opens the check-out date picker.\n   527→- **Expected:** Dates on or before \"2026-05-01\" are disabled/grayed out. Only dates after the check-in date are selectable.\n   528→\n   529→#### Test: Guest count cannot exceed property max_guests\n   530→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page for a property with max_guests 4.\n   531→- **Action:** User tries to set the guest count higher than 4.\n   532→- **Expected:** The guest count selector prevents selecting more than 4 guests. The maximum is capped at 4.\n   533→\n   534→#### Test: Guest count minimum is 1\n   535→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n   536→- **Action:** User interacts with the guest count selector.\n   537→- **Expected:** The minimum selectable value is 1. The user cannot set guests to 0 or a negative number.\n   538→\n   539→#### Test: Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n   540→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on a property detail page. The property has an existing confirmed booking for \"2026-05-01\" to \"2026-05-04\".\n   541→- **Action:** User selects overlapping dates (e.g., check-in \"2026-05-02\", check-out \"2026-05-06\") and clicks \"Reserve\".\n   542→- **Expected:** An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Property is not available for the selected dates\"). The booking is not created.\n   543→\n   544→#### Test: Booking card is sticky on desktop viewport\n   545→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page on a desktop viewport.\n   546→- **Action:** User scrolls down the page past the booking card's initial position.\n   547→- **Expected:** The booking card remains visible in a sticky sidebar position as the user scrolls through the property description, amenities, and reviews.\n   548→\n   549→#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n   550→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page.\n   551→- **Action:** User selects check-in \"2026-05-01\" and check-out \"2026-05-04\", then changes check-in to \"2026-06-01\" and check-out to \"2026-06-05\", then changes guest count from 2 to 4 and back to 2.\n   552→- **Expected:** Each change correctly updates the price breakdown. The final state shows \"2026-06-01\" to \"2026-06-05\" with 2 guests.\n   553→\n   554→### Component: ReviewsSection\n   555→\n   556→#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n   557→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with multiple reviews. The average ratings are: cleanliness 4.5, accuracy 4.2, communication 4.8, location 4.6, value 4.0.\n   558→- **Expected:** The reviews section shows a summary with average ratings for each category: \"Cleanliness: 4.5\", \"Accuracy: 4.2\", \"Communication: 4.8\", \"Location: 4.6\", \"Value: 4.0\". Each rating is displayed with a star icon or progress bar. An overall average rating is also displayed.\n   559→\n   560→#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n   561→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with 15 reviews and an overall average rating of 4.3.\n   562→- **Expected:** The reviews section header shows a star icon with \"4.3\" and \"15 reviews\" (or similar format like \"4.3 · 15 reviews\").\n   563→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015uXTmpbyoF4wrMgqSUBzfA","session_id":"40a51b1f-3249-44ca-a03e-506c11f5118e","uuid":"b45f48ee-6510-459b-9346-052b3752cf28"}
