[2026-03-15T21:15:15.718Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PgMhPjhC7KXdKHhTJ8N6Ef","type":"tool_result","content":"   560→#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n   561→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with 15 reviews and an overall average rating of 4.3.\n   562→- **Expected:** The reviews section header shows a star icon with \"4.3\" and \"15 reviews\" (or similar format like \"4.3 · 15 reviews\").\n   563→\n   564→#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n   565→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A review exists from guest \"Alice\" dated \"2026-01-15\" with rating 5 and comment \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n   566→- **Expected:** An individual review card is displayed showing the guest name \"Alice\", the date \"January 2026\" (or similar formatted date), a star rating of 5, and the comment text \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n   567→\n   568→#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n   569→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A reviewer has an avatar_url set, another reviewer does not.\n   570→- **Expected:** Review cards show the guest's avatar image when available. When no avatar is set, a placeholder (e.g., first initial in a circle) is displayed.\n   571→\n   572→#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n   573→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no reviews.\n   574→- **Expected:** The reviews section displays a message like \"No reviews yet\" instead of an empty review list. Category average ratings are not shown.\n   575→\n   576→#### Test: Reviews section handles pagination or \"Show more\" for many reviews\n   577→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with more than 6 reviews.\n   578→- **Expected:** An initial subset of reviews is displayed (e.g., 6 reviews). A \"Show all X reviews\" button is visible at the bottom (where X is the total count).\n   579→\n   580→#### Test: Clicking \"Show all reviews\" reveals all review cards\n   581→- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with more than 6 reviews and a \"Show all X reviews\" button visible.\n   582→- **Action:** User clicks \"Show all X reviews\".\n   583→- **Expected:** All review cards are displayed. The button disappears or changes to \"Show less\".\n   584→\n   585→#### Test: Reviews are ordered by most recent first\n   586→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with multiple reviews created on different dates.\n   587→- **Expected:** Review cards are displayed in reverse chronological order, with the most recently created review appearing first.\n   588→\n   589→### Component: HostInfoCard\n   590→\n   591→#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n   592→- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id`. The property host has name \"Jane Host\", an avatar_url, bio \"Superhostess who loves sharing her properties\", and created_at \"2023-06-15\".\n   593→- **Expected:** The host info card displays: the host's avatar image, name \"Jane Host\", bio text \"Superhostess who loves sharing her properties\", and \"Member since June 2023\" (formatted from created_at).\n   594→\n   595→#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n   596→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has 5 active property listings.\n   597→- **Expected:** The host info card shows \"5 listings\" (or similar format like \"5 properties\").\n   598→\n   599→#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n   600→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has avatar_url set to null.\n   601→- **Expected:** A placeholder avatar (e.g., first initial in a circle or a generic person icon) is displayed instead of a broken image.\n   602→\n   603→#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n   604→- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has bio set to null.\n   605→- **Expected:** The host info card displays the host name, avatar, and member since date. The bio area is either not shown or displays a default message. No empty or broken layout.\n   606→\n   607→## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n   608→\n   609→<!-- Components: TripsTabs, TripCard, CancelBookingDialog -->\n   610→\n   611→### Component: TripsTabs\n   612→\n   613→#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n   614→- **Initial state:** User is not logged in.\n   615→- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips`.\n   616→- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). The My Trips page content is not displayed.\n   617→\n   618→#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n   619→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips`.\n   620→- **Expected:** The page displays three tabs: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", and \"Cancelled\". The \"Upcoming\" tab is selected/highlighted by default. The content area shows upcoming trips (bookings with status \"pending\" or \"confirmed\" and check_in date >= today).\n   621→\n   622→#### Test: Upcoming tab shows pending and confirmed future bookings\n   623→- **Initial state:** User is logged in with bookings: a confirmed booking checking in next week, a pending booking checking in next month, a completed booking from last month, and a cancelled booking.\n   624→- **Action:** User is on the \"Upcoming\" tab.\n   625→- **Expected:** Only the confirmed and pending future bookings are displayed. Completed and cancelled bookings are not shown in this tab.\n   626→\n   627→#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n   628→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has completed bookings.\n   629→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n   630→- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show only bookings with status \"completed\". Upcoming and cancelled bookings are not shown.\n   631→\n   632→#### Test: Switching to Cancelled tab shows cancelled bookings\n   633→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has cancelled bookings.\n   634→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cancelled\" tab.\n   635→- **Expected:** The \"Cancelled\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show only bookings with status \"cancelled\". Upcoming and completed bookings are not shown.\n   636→\n   637→#### Test: Switching back to Upcoming tab from another tab\n   638→- **Initial state:** User is on the My Trips page with the \"Past\" tab selected.\n   639→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Upcoming\" tab.\n   640→- **Expected:** The \"Upcoming\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show upcoming bookings again.\n   641→\n   642→#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n   643→- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no completed bookings.\n   644→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n   645→- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab content area displays a message like \"No past trips\" or \"You don't have any past trips yet.\" instead of an empty list.\n   646→\n   647→#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n   648→- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no pending or confirmed future bookings.\n   649→- **Action:** User views the \"Upcoming\" tab (default).\n   650→- **Expected:** The tab content area displays a message like \"No upcoming trips\" with a suggestion to browse properties (e.g., a link to the home page).\n   651→\n   652→#### Test: Cancelled tab empty state message\n   653→- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no cancelled bookings.\n   654→- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cancelled\" tab.\n   655→- **Expected:** The tab content area displays a message like \"No cancelled trips.\"\n   656→\n   657→#### Test: Tabs are functional on repeated use\n   658→- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page.\n   659→- **Action:** User clicks \"Past\", then \"Cancelled\", then \"Upcoming\", then \"Past\" again."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015uXTmpbyoF4wrMgqSUBzfA","session_id":"40a51b1f-3249-44ca-a03e-506c11f5118e","uuid":"4b4b38a0-51bd-4d69-a039-3326c29bebde"}
