arah was a wonderful host. Would definitely stay again.',\n    35→    },\n    36→  })\n    37→  // Re-create seed review for b4444444 (Alex, rating 4)\n    38→  await page.request.post('/api/reviews', {\n    39→    data: {\n    40→      booking_id: 'e4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444',\n    41→      property_id: PROPERTY_SINGULAR,\n    42→      guest_id: ALEX_ID,\n    43→      rating: 4,\n    44→      cleanliness: 4,\n    45→      accuracy: 4,\n    46→      communication: 5,\n    47→      location: 5,\n    48→      value: 4,\n    49→      comment: 'Great location in SoCo. The apartment was clean and well-equipped. The rooftop pool was a nice bonus. Only wish the bedroom was a bit larger.',\n    50→    },\n    51→  })\n    52→}\n    53→\n    54→test.describe('Property Detail - PropertyHeader', () => {\n    55→  test.beforeAll(async ({ browser }) => {\n    56→    const page = await browser.newPage()\n    57→    await resetReviewsToSeed(page)\n    58→    await page.close()\n    59→  })\n    60→  test('Property header displays title, location, rating summary, and host info', async ({ page }) => {\n    61→    await page.goto(`/properties/${PROPERTY_WITH_REVIEWS}`)\n    62→\n    63→    const header = page.getByTestId('property-header')\n    64→    await expect(header).toBeVisible({ timeout: 30000 })\n    65→\n    66→    // Title\n    67→    await expect(header.locator('h1')).toHaveText('Cozy Downtown Loft with City Views')\n    68→\n    69→    // Location\n    70→    await expect(header).toContainText('New York, United States')\n    71→\n    72→    // Rating summary - property has 1 review with rating 5\n    73→    const reviewLink = page.getByTestId('review-count-link')\n    74→    await expect(reviewLink).toBeVisible()\n    75→    await expect(reviewLink).toContainText('5.0')\n    76→    await expect(reviewLink).toContainText('(1 review)')\n    77→\n    78→    // Host info\n    79→    await expect(header).toContainText('Hosted by')\n    80→    await expect(header).toC